{"schema_version": "source-unit-v2.0", "unit_id": "76e6ee94346f7a1f", "unit_type": "formula_package", "introduction": "6.2.2 利用乔木层样方调查得到的物种、每木检尺胸径、林冠层郁闭度等数据，计算乔木层VQI_乔。将乔木层每个物种每木检尺得到的胸高断面积之和（BA_i）作为权重因子纳入公式；利用林冠层郁闭度生成盖度修正因子（M_林冠层），随着郁闭度从0%～100%变化，M_林冠层数值范围为0.75～1.25。利用公式（2）（3）计算VQI_乔：", "interstitial_text": "当样方乔木层所有物种单位面积胸高断面积之和>BA_prime时，采用如下公式计算VQI_乔：", "adjacent_source_text": "", "formulas": [{"formula_number": "2", "expression_text": "VQI_乔=sum(BA_i*C_i)/BA_prime*10*M_林冠层", "expression_lines": ["VQI_乔=sum(BA_i*C_i)/BA_prime*10*M_林冠层"], "evidence_span": {"span_id": "35886b65e443e2ca", "page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "text": "公式（2）：VQI_乔=sum(BA_i*C_i)/BA_prime*10*M_林冠层", "bbox": [90, 295, 510, 331], "line_ids": ["65670fbda1549211"], "raw_text": "……………………（2）", "transcription": "visual_equation_transcription_with_original_text_and_page_bbox"}}, {"formula_number": "3", "expression_text": "M_林冠层=0.75+0.005*CC", "expression_lines": ["M_林冠层=0.75+0.005*CC"], "evidence_span": {"span_id": "0e48cb826fa4bf6e", "page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "text": "公式（3）：M_林冠层=0.75+0.005*CC", "bbox": [90, 334, 510, 362], "line_ids": ["f32809fb4fd06837"], "raw_text": "……………………（3）", "transcription": "visual_equation_transcription_with_original_text_and_page_bbox"}}, {"formula_number": "4", "expression_text": "VQI_乔=sum(BA_i*C_i)/BA_total*10*M_林冠层", "expression_lines": ["VQI_乔=sum(BA_i*C_i)/BA_total*10*M_林冠层"], "evidence_span": {"span_id": "0294ec264ed9e3c4", "page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "text": "公式（4）：VQI_乔=sum(BA_i*C_i)/BA_total*10*M_林冠层", "bbox": [90, 570, 510, 594], "line_ids": ["b65d1505e2064247"], "raw_text": "……………………（4）", "transcription": "visual_equation_transcription_with_original_text_and_page_bbox"}}], "variable_definitions": [{"symbol": "VQI_乔", "definition": "样方乔木层植被质量指数，数值范围为0～125，无量纲", "unit": "", "evidence_span": {"span_id": "f45d3bfc8bacd72c", "page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "text": "VQI_乔——样方乔木层植被质量指数，数值范围为0～125，无量纲", "bbox": [110.42, 386.979, 427.518, 398.331], "line_i